# Means of Grace — Alarm System

## iPhone sound (critical)

- **In-app loop**: iOS uses native `AlarmAudioPlugin.swift` — respects `AlarmSoundPreferences`.
- **Watchdog**: `AlarmSoundService` 2s timer restarts native loop if `_wantPlaying` && not `_previewMode`.
- **Prayer screens**: 2s screen watchdog only when `_shouldRingAlarm` (ringing state).
- **Stop sets `_wantPlaying = false`** — required before STT or sound keeps restarting.
- **Settings preview**: `previewSample()` 2s; `_previewMode` disables service watchdog.
- **Select sound** = save only; separate Preview button.
- **Info.plist**: `UIBackgroundModes` includes `audio`.
- **Start sound**: `main.dart` calls `start()` before Navigator push when notification opens alarm.

## Sound during recording (DO NOT REGRESS)

- Alarm plays **ringing screen only**.
- `_startListening` must call `stop()` for **both** live and preview morning alarms.
- Never call `ensurePlaying()` after `_speech.listen()`.

## Notifications (iOS)

- Must request **alert + sound** — check `hasPermissions()` uses both.
- `scheduleFromPreferences()` returns `AlarmScheduleStatus`; aborts if permission denied.
- **24-hour scheduling**: any hour 0–23 via `AlarmRegistry`; daily repeat + backup IDs 11/12.
- **Watchdog backup**: `AlarmFireWatchdog` 90s window; `resetDaily()` on prefs save only.
- **Foreground**: `AppDelegate` → `alarm_launch` → opens alarm UI + sound.
- Per-payload debounce in `main.dart` (2 min, separate morning/evening keys).
- Test: Settings → "Test morning alarm" (5 seconds).

## Morning prayer lock

- `AlarmSessionService.isMorningCompletionRequired()` after alarm time if not completed today.
- `AppLaunchGate` shows blocking `AlarmScreen(isLiveAlarm: true)` until Done.
- Sound stops when user starts prayer (listening), not only on success.
- Preview uses `isLiveAlarm: false` (no lock).

## Speech (morning/evening)

- English prayer text → English STT (`SpeechMatchUtils.speechLocalePrefix`).
- **85%** ordered word match auto-advances intermediate steps only; **last step requires Amen**.
- Live alarm: no cancel/skip; must read each step before Next.

## Install on device

Release build (debug cannot launch from home screen on Personal Team):

```bash
cd ios && xcodebuild -workspace Runner.xcworkspace -scheme Runner \
  -configuration Release -destination 'id=DEVICE_UDID' -allowProvisioningUpdates build
xcrun devicectl device install app --device DEVICE_UUID \
  ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/Runner-*/Build/Products/Release-iphoneos/Runner.app
```

## User checklist

1. iPhone Settings → Means of Grace → Notifications → Allow + Sounds
2. Set alarm time in app Settings (auto-saves)
3. Test with "Test morning alarm" (5 seconds)
